.TH start-tunnel-port-forward-remove 1  "remove "
.SH NAME
start\-tunnel\-port\-forward\-remove \- Remove port forward
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-tunnel port\-forward remove\fR [\fB\-\-protocol\fR] [\fB\-\-fallback\fR] [\fB\-\-hostname\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISOURCE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove port forward
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-protocol\fR \fI<PROTOCOL>\fR
Limit removal to TCP or UDP. Omit to remove the whole forward; hostname or fallback selection defaults to TCP
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
tcp
.IP \(bu 2
udp
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-fallback\fR
Remove only the selected transport\*(Aqs hostname\-less fallback
.TP
\fB\-\-hostname\fR \fI<HOSTNAME>\fR
Selects a hostname; omitted removes the selected routes and fallback
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISOURCE\fR>

